---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site, pricing } from '../lib/site';
---
<Page title="Terms" description={`${site.studio} terms in plain English.`} heading="Terms" eyebrow="Plain English">
  <div class="wrap prose legal">
    <p class="draft">Draft, pending attorney review before launch. Each project also gets a one-page proposal that governs if it differs.</p>
    <h2>Free frames</h2>
    <p>Five frames, one concept, one round of light tweaks, delivered by email in 3–5 business days and marked "AI concept". You may keep them and share them inside your team. They are free and create no obligation.</p>
    <h2>Films</h2>
    <p>Every hero film is a single continuous 30-second take. Deliverables, timing and price are as listed on the <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a>. {pricing.allPlans}</p>
    <h2>Payment and approval</h2>
    <p>Premiere and Short: 50 % to start, 50 % on approval of the final film. If two revision rounds don't win you over, you owe no balance and you don't receive the final files; the deposit covers the work done. If the first take is late through our fault, the balance drops 10 %. Season: monthly in advance, 3-month minimum, then 30 days' notice.</p>
    <h2>Spec work and AI</h2>
    <p>Films on this site are spec films for invented brands. All footage is AI-generated and labelled as such. We don't guarantee sales or ad performance.</p>
  </div>
</Page>
<style>.legal { padding-bottom: 96px; }</style>
